# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  [Average gate fidelity](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info#average_gate_fidelity) of the two-qubit operation from randomized benchmarking. Measured in \"isolation\": batches with a minimum separation of two qubits between edges. This randomized benchmarking uses alternating layers of single-qubit Cliffords and two-qubit gates, and thus the final 2Q error value includes the error of the layer of single-qubit Cliffords.\n"
msgstr "[Fidelidad de puerta promedio](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info#average_gate_fidelity) de la operación de dos qubits obtenida a partir de benchmarking aleatorizado. Medido en \"aislamiento\": lotes con una separación mínima de dos qubits entre aristas. Este benchmarking aleatorizado usa capas alternadas de Cliffords de un qubit y puertas de dos qubits, por lo que el valor final del error 2Q incluye el error de la capa de Cliffords de un qubit.\n"

